  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: da967a0ca1faba14ea2f13ad6e50edd2, type: 3}
  m_Name: Blue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Blue
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 01f015c152dea3a41b7966d29a5ab282, type: 3}
  age: 14
  gender: 0
  birthdate: 
  appearance: Short, messy, blue-gray hair, large, bright eyes with a curious look.
    He wears a work jumpsuit tailored to his size, full of pockets to store small
    tools and components. His hands are scarred from spending hours with metal and
    circuits. He always wears a torn glove that Vulkan gave him.
  personalityTraits: 0f00000003000000
  motivations: To become a great inventor and builder, like Vulkan. He wants to be
    recognized by him, not as a son, but as an equal.
  background: 'Blue was found in the rubble of an ancient settlement after a structural
    collapse. Vulkan, who was inspecting the area for reusable parts, heard soft
    knocks inside a box half-covered with scrap metal. Inside, was a small child,
    dehydrated but alive, clutching a small toy flashlight.



    Vulkan didn''t
    hesitate: he took him home and raised him as his own. Since then, Blue has become
    his shadow, observing, learning, and helping at the forge. Despite his age, he
    is skilled and creative, and has already built useful gadgets such as folding
    mechanical arms or small reconnaissance drones.'
  speechStyle: 3
  otherInfo: 'Vulkan never wanted to impose himself as a father, but Blue considers
    him her role model. Vulkan sees in Blue a reflection of the decisions he makes:
    if Blue becomes corrupt, it is a sign that perhaps he has strayed from the right
    path. But if he flourishes, it will mean that the legacy he is building is worthy.'
